              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " orugote, orwombekyeho ebigo, orurundeho eby'okutemberaho, kandi oruteereho ensiisira kururwanisa, orubyareho ebiti by'okuhiguza orugo embaju zoona; ",
