              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekyo ndyakikora, ngu baboe kutuubirwa eby'okurya byabo n'amaizi gaabo, baareebane bonka na bonka bashobeirwe, bahwe aha magufa ahabw'okufubirwa kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
